{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "754d69ac-1d52-8c0c-ad18-5b7e83c3416a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-16T10:48:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Margaret Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T10:46:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T10:46:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Margaret Almy. I manage a property at 462 Bliss Road, over on the Easton's Beach side, and I am calling about the water and sewer bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T10:46:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Almy. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T10:46:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A new meter was installed there last month, and the bill that came afterward looks off to me. It is considerably higher than I would expect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T10:46:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. Higher than what you usually see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T10:46:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Last year's winter bills were much lower. Nothing about the building has changed, and the use is the same. [line breaks up] I beg your pardon, I lost you for a moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T10:46:43-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you're breaking up a little. I said that when a new meter goes in, the first bill can mix old estimated readings with the new actual ones, so it can jump. It doesn't always mean there's a problem, but it's worth a look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T10:46:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Would you kindly repeat the part about the estimated readings? The line is poor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T10:47:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Sometimes the old meter was billed on an estimate. Then the new meter reads the real use, and the bill catches up all at once. So I want to compare the readings on your account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T10:47:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is helpful, thank you. I am on a short break from a night shift at a warehouse, so I cannot stay on very long, and the reception where I am standing is not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T10:47:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Let me get the account pulled up and review it, and I can call you back with an answer. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T10:47:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0167. Kindly call after noon if you can, as I will be asleep until then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T10:47:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After noon, got it. 401-555-0167, for Margaret Almy at 462 Bliss Road. I'll look at the meter readings and call you today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T10:47:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. I appreciate your help. Good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T10:47:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Ms. Almy. Get some rest."
    }
  ],
